Playing XIs on every match: the Info tab shows both elevens, captains and keepers, with the bench a tap away — or each squad before the toss.

All matches can now be browsed by date, from yesterday's results to next week's fixtures.

Team pages list recent results with the side's form.

Reminders you set on a match are listed and can be cancelled: open the bell, then Reminders.

Lighter in the background, too — fewer wake-ups and less data.
